<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="HEB" style="id">- NUMANA</book>
  <para style="h">HEB - NUMANA</para>
  <para style="toc1">HEB - NUMANA</para>
  <para style="toc2">HEB - NUMANA</para>
  <para style="toc3">HEB - NUMANA</para>
  <para style="mt1">HEB - NUMANA</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="HEB 1" />
  <para style="s">Ilɛ kɛ Arik ndi ire ben Izu maa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="HEB 1:1" />Nǝ ikukub Arik ne lɛ ben atsintsim amɔr ize bǝn abɛ shar amaa amkpaŋ tetɛk ne nkunkɔŋ tetɛk, <verse eid="HEB 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="HEB 1:2" />ama ne bɛr yi klɛtu yiŋɛ ne lɛ ben abɛta ize ben Izu maa, iwaŋ ndi ne hriau te ikiki bɔbɔk ibǝyi maa, ne yi wa ne na gɔŋmimi. <verse eid="HEB 1:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="HEB 1:3" />Izu maa ai wa ayi ilaŋ yi ngɔŋ iye Arik iwa ana yi ndi Arik, agli ikiki bɔbɔk ne mgbyamgbyaŋ kɛ lɛ maa. Ndi ne ka ŋla ta ne lalɛ mɔr, ne sɔŋ ne ŋɔk li kɛ Arik ne gbarshu. <verse eid="HEB 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="HEB 1:4" />Fe Arik ne duŋ Izu maa ai ŋgɔŋ anaŋ abɛ shar amaa, ir keŋ ndi sak keŋ ndi ne nǝgu ne naŋ mǝne.<verse eid="HEB 1:4" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ŋgɔŋ kɛ Izu Arik</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="HEB 1:5" />Fe Arik ba ne di abɛ shar amaa anuŋ te di,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 1:5">&lt;&lt;Uyi zu muŋ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 1:5">Aliŋe myi Tetɛɛ mi.&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="m" vid="HEB 1:5">Ka Arik ne di ne shar amaa,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 1:5">&lt;&lt;M tei yi Tetɛɛ amaa iwa atei na yi Izu muŋ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="HEB 1:5" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="HEB 1:6" />Ama ndi ne tei shar Izu maa ne kuti ne gɔŋmimi, ne gli, abɛ shar Arik bɔbɔk mǝne te gbaru.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="HEB 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="HEB 1:7" />Ama abɛ shar Arik ne di ba,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 1:7">&lt;&lt;Arik ne duŋ abɛ shar amaa abɛ yi izhu maa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 1:7">Te agɛn amaa abɛ yi lǝlɛn lu.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="HEB 1:7" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="HEB 1:8" />Ama ne atu ayi Izu maa Arik ne di,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 1:8">&lt;&lt;Arik, Ikɔb ngɔŋ mi, ba yi ne klɛ tu ba,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 1:8">Utei gli aneshir ami ne ankɔŋ adidik.<verse eid="HEB 1:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="HEB 1:9" />Unyɛr iki didik te kyak zumimin.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 1:9">Waŋa ayi iki yiŋ ndi Arik, Arik ami, ne hriau</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 1:9">Te nǝgu nyɛr ne susun bǝn ngɔŋ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 1:9">Inaŋ akpa ami.<verse eid="HEB 1:9" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="HEB 1:10" />Ne na di,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 1:10">&lt;&lt;Iwa, Ŋgɔŋ, Une kuti na gɔŋmimi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 1:10">Ne aŋɔk ami une na igbarshu.<verse eid="HEB 1:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="HEB 1:11" />Ikiki bɔbɔk itei naŋadɔ, ama Iwa uyi me;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 1:11">Itei ce ndi anklu.<verse eid="HEB 1:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="HEB 1:12" />Utei nyen kɛ ku ndi anklu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 1:12">Atei sɛn kɛ ndi anklu.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 1:12">Ama Iwa unak yi ir keŋ ndi Uyime,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 1:12">Bau yi ne klɛtu ba.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="HEB 1:12" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="HEB 1:13" />Ndi amɛ, Arik bane di abɛ shar amaa nuŋ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 1:13">&lt;&lt;Zǝ sɔŋ ayaŋ ne ŋɔk li muŋ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 1:13">Se Mne duŋ abɛ te zor ami</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 1:13">Abɛ yi iki caŋ ne aza mi.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="HEB 1:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="HEB 1:14" />Tǝ ane ŋɔɔ ba ayi abɛ shar Arik? ayi izhu yiŋ ndi anaa Arik ndum ndi iwa ne shar ba te abɛ lɔk abaŋ ndi ne yik ta zhɔk iye Arik.<verse eid="HEB 1:14" /></para>
  <chapter eid="HEB 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="HEB 2" />
  <para style="s">Ita zhɔk ngɔŋ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="HEB 2:1" />Ne me ta bǝ nak te zee, ne ilɛ didik kǝŋ ndi ta ne wɔi ngɔŋ, te kǝr iki nuŋ bǝ baŋ asusun amɔr ba. <verse eid="HEB 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="HEB 2:2" />Ilɛ keŋ ndi abɛ shar ayou Arik ne bla antsintsim amɔr ne kɛ ne yi lɛ didik, abaŋ ndi ne kyak zǝ kɛ ne yik iyah yiŋ ndi ne tei ba anenen. <verse eid="HEB 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="HEB 2:3" />Tǝ ta tei na kikin, te lieru te ta tei kyak ta zhɔk ŋgon yiŋɛ? Ita zhɔk yiŋ ndi Ŋgɔŋ wa ne bla kɛ, abaŋ ndi ne wɔu ne bla ta ne kɛ. <verse eid="HEB 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="HEB 2:4" />Nǝ mkpaŋ yuŋɔ Arik ne na tsarǝ te iyi amɛ ne na iki yi yik, ben yi vuŋ anu, te gab izhi yi Izhu tsetser kaŋkaŋ ir keŋ ndi ne teu.<verse eid="HEB 2:4" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ita zhɔk yiŋ ndi ire ben Kristi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="HEB 2:5" />Arik ba ne duŋ abɛ shar amaa abɛ yi abɛ gli igɔŋmimi yayas ndi atei na kɛ, ikeŋ ndi ta lǝlɛ maa. <verse eid="HEB 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="HEB 2:6" />Neme amkpa anuŋ ayime ndi inuŋ ne ka yigu:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 2:6">&lt;&lt;Arik, ineshir ayi ŋɔwa ndi utei lǝlɛ maa ne susun mi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 2:6">Iner ne sha te Utei kam tɔu?<verse eid="HEB 2:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="HEB 2:7" />Une duŋ aneshir ne naŋ abɛ shar ami watsɔb;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 2:7">Une nyɛn ba ne ngɔŋ bǝn gbar asak,<verse eid="HEB 2:7" /></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="HEB 2:8" />Te na duŋ ikiki bɔbɔk ibǝ yi ne angus amen.&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="m" vid="HEB 2:8">Ndi ilɛ kɛ Arik ne di duŋ kiki bɔbɔk ibǝ yi &lt;&lt;ne angus amaa&gt;&gt;; ba ne duŋ kinuŋ ba. Ama azizaŋa ba ta ne yik ner nuŋ iwaŋ ndi kiki yi gɔŋmimi iyi ne angus amaa ba. <verse eid="HEB 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="HEB 2:9" />Fe ta ne yik Yesɔ, ne duŋu aklu aŋin watsɔb bǝn abɛ shar ayou Arik, ne nyɛnu ne ŋgɔŋ bǝn gbara sak te na yik iyah ne iku, ne na iki didik yi Arik abɛ ku ne atu aye aneshir bɔbɔk.<verse eid="HEB 2:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="HEB 2:10" />Nǝ rɛ ankyak ndi Arik, iwa ndi nena tena kam kiki bɔbɔk aŋyak, ne duŋ Yesɔ a shaga ne yik iyah, te abɛ gli aneshir tetɛk bɛ yik ita ngɔŋ. Tǝ Yesɔ wa ne akuti anǝk ba ita zhɔk.<verse eid="HEB 2:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="HEB 2:11" />Ama iwaŋ ndi ne duŋ aneshir abɛ yi tsetser bǝn abaŋ ndi ayi tsetser ai ŋli kɛ Tetɛɛ zhiin. Waŋa ayi ki yiŋ ndi Yesɔ ba ne te shisha ne zhɔ ba te amunya ba. <verse eid="HEB 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="HEB 2:12" />Ne di Arik:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 2:12">&lt;&lt;M tei bla amunya isak mi.&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 2:12">M tei gbaru asak ne biŋ aneshir.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="HEB 2:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="HEB 2:13" />Ne na di, &lt;&lt;M tei tanyɛme ben Arik.&gt;&gt; te na di, &lt;&lt;Tǝ nga waŋ ben amumun abaŋ ndi Arik ne nǝm ne ba.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="HEB 2:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="HEB 2:14" />Ndi amumun ne ayi ne kpa bǝn azhizhi, Yesɔ maayi ne baŋ ikpa kɛ neshir tena naa me ne iku maa te iwa abɛ ŋun ishetan, ndi wa agli mgbyamgbyaŋ kɛ ku, <verse eid="HEB 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="HEB 2:15" />te na zuk abaŋ ndi ne yi agɛn ire ŋli men ne te sisik iku. <verse eid="HEB 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="HEB 2:16" />Nǝ yi amɛ ba ne lɔk abɛ shar Arik ba ama ne yi ŋli kɛ Ibrai. <verse eid="HEB 2:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="HEB 2:17" />Ne me ne kama tǝ ndi amunzumen ne kɔte ankɔŋ atawa, te abɛyi Ngɔŋ abɛ na ndum ne Akaba ne lɔ susun ben ina didik ne na ndum kɛ Arik, te na nek itu maa te abɛ zuk aneshir ashur ne lalɛ men. <verse eid="HEB 2:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="HEB 2:18" />Iwa maayi ne yik iyah ndi ne tsa ru atɔ, te abɛ lɔk abaŋ ndi ayik iyah ne tsar.<verse eid="HEB 2:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="HEB 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="HEB 3" />
  <para style="s">Yesɔ anaŋ Musa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="HEB 3:1" />Amunya abɛ zǝ Kristi, abaŋ ndi Arik ne zhɔ ba, izhin bǝ duŋ asusun amin abɛ yi ben Yesɔ, iwaŋ ndi Arik ne duŋ abɛ yi ngɔŋ ne na ndum ne Akaba ndi ta ne tanyɛme ne wu. <verse eid="HEB 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="HEB 3:2" />Ne na izub ne ti kɛ Arik, ir keŋ ndi Musa ne na zub ne ndum maa ne kɔb Arik. <verse eid="HEB 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="HEB 3:3" />Ner waŋ ndi amɛ kɔb ata ngɔŋ anaŋ ikɔbɔ. ina yi anenen ben Yesɔ ayi ngɔŋ anaŋ Musa. <verse eid="HEB 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="HEB 3:4" />kɔte ikɔb takɛ aye aner anuŋ ne mee kɛ, ama Arik wa ne mee kiki bɔbɔk. <verse eid="HEB 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="HEB 3:5" />Musa ane yi igen nena zub ne ndum maa ne ikɔb Arik, ne bla ikiki yiŋ ndi Arik atei blai ne ti. <verse eid="HEB 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="HEB 3:6" />Ama Kristi ana zub ne ndum maa ne ikɔb Arik. taba tayi ikɔb kɛ mee maa ate yi ndi tate kli mgbamgbaŋ tena nek atu ne ki shur ayi mɔr.<verse eid="HEB 3:6" /></para>
  <para style="s">Isɔŋ sik abɛ zǝ Arik</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="HEB 3:7" />Fena, ndi Izhu tsetser ne di:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 3:7">&lt;&lt;Aliŋe, izhin te wɔ kɔr kɛ Arik,<verse eid="HEB 3:7" /></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="HEB 3:8" />Kǝr izhin bǝ kpa asusun amin ba, ir keŋ ndi atsintsim amin ne kyak wɔ lɛ kɛ Arik,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 3:8">Ndi ne yi ne zizik ne mkpaŋ keŋ ndi ne tsa ru.<verse eid="HEB 3:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="HEB 3:9" />Arik adi, atsintsim amin ne tsar te na wɔb me ne akla,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 3:9">Ne yik iki yiŋ ndi Mne naa ba ase sɔk nas.<verse eid="HEB 3:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="HEB 3:10" />Neme Mne te mfu ne kab ŋli yuŋɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 3:10">Te ndi, &lt;&lt;Asusun amene ne te gbagbaŋ ben abɛm,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 3:10">Te na kyak zǝ ilɛ muŋ.&gt;<verse eid="HEB 3:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="HEB 3:11" />Fe Mne te mfu te na she arim te ndi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 3:11">&lt;Batei yir amkpa waŋ ndi ne tei nek ba te abɛ sɔŋ asik ge ba.&gt;&gt;&gt;<verse eid="HEB 3:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="HEB 3:12" />Amunya abɛ zǝ Kristi, izhin bǝ te zee kǝr inuŋ ne miŋ mine abɛ yi ne susun mimin ba, te yaŋ tanyɛme te kam goŋ anǝk Arik waŋ ndi ayi tsitsir ba. <verse eid="HEB 3:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="HEB 3:13" />Nǝ yiŋɛ, kǝr nuŋ ne miŋ min abɛ duŋ zumimin lɔmu tǝ bɛ kpa susun, izhin bǝ lɔk akpa mine kɔte bɛr tayi, ndi nkanlɛ &lt;&lt;Iye aliŋ&gt;&gt; ndi ilɛ kɛ Arik iblaa ta. <verse eid="HEB 3:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="HEB 3:14" />Te ta ne biŋ bɔbɔk ben Kristi ate yi ndi tate kli mgbamgbaŋ te gar klɛtu ndi tate nek asusun amɔr ne kuti. <verse eid="HEB 3:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="HEB 3:15" />Waŋa ayi ki yiŋ ndi ilɛ kɛ Arik ne di:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 3:15">&lt;&lt;Aliŋe, izhin te wɔ lɛ kɛ Arik,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 3:15">Kǝr izhin bɛ kpa asusun amimin ba</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 3:15">Ir keŋ ndi atsintsim amin ne kyak zǝ lɛ kɛ Arik.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="HEB 3:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="HEB 3:16" />Ne yi ane ŋɔɔ ba ndi ne wɔ kɔr kɛ Arik te kyak ke? Ba bɔbɔk mǝne Musa ne Gli ba rumɔ ne Masar ka? <verse eid="HEB 3:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="HEB 3:17" />Ane ŋɔɔ ba Arik ne te mfu ben abɛba ase sɔk nas? Ba neyi abɛ na zumimin, abaŋ ndi ane azhaku aku ne zizik. <verse eid="HEB 3:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="HEB 3:18" />Ndi Arik ne kpa nyak, &lt;&lt;Ba atei yir amkpa awaŋ ndi Mbǝ nek ba sɔŋ sik&gt;&gt; alɛ ben ane ŋɔi? aye abaŋ ndi ne kyak zǝ lɛ kɛ Arik. <verse eid="HEB 3:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="HEB 3:19" />Fe ta yik, ba ne yir amkpa ma ba, te ne kyak tanyɛme.<verse eid="HEB 3:19" /></para>
  <chapter eid="HEB 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="HEB 4" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="HEB 4:1" />Azizaŋa, ndi Arik ne nek ta kpa nyak te tabǝ ta sɔŋ sik yiŋ ndi ne blama. Ta bǝ te zee te kǝr inuŋ ne miŋ min abɛ yaŋ ta kpa nyak iyi sɔŋ sik iyiŋɛ ba. <verse eid="HEB 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="HEB 4:2" />Tǝ tane wɔ ilɛ didik, ir keŋ ndi aba menyi ne wɔkɛ. Ndi ne wɔ ilɛmɛ ama bane naa ba ikinuŋ didik ba, ndi ne wɔ kɛ, ba ne takɛ ne susun zhiin ba. <verse eid="HEB 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="HEB 4:3" />Tǝ taba ndi tane tanyɛme, neme, tǝ ta yi iki yiŋ ndi Arik ne akpai aŋyak. Ir keŋ ndi ne di:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 4:3">&lt;&lt;Mne te mfu ne bla lɛ kɛ kpa nyak:</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 4:3">&lt;Ba tei yir amkpa awaŋ ndi Mbǝ nek ba te bɛ sɔŋ asik ge!&gt;&gt;&gt; Ne bla amɛ ama ndum maa ne ka klɛ ire mkpaŋ kɛ na gɔŋmimi. <verse eid="HEB 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="HEB 4:4" />Icɛr nuŋ ne di ne lɛ kɛ Arik ne atu ayi bɛr taŋgba: &lt;&lt;Arik ne sɔŋ asik ne bɛr yi taŋgba ndi ne na ndum maa bɔbɔk.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="HEB 4:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="HEB 4:5" />Ilɛ kǝŋe nena lɛ kɛ: &lt;&lt;Ba tei yir ntun yiŋ ndi M tei nek ba te bǝ sɔŋ asik ba.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="HEB 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="HEB 4:6" />Abaŋ ndi ne kuti awɔ lɛ didik ba ne yir amkpa ne sɔŋ sik ba, te bane tanyɛme ne kɛ ba. Fena, aduŋ anuŋ ne ta kɛ. <verse eid="HEB 4:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="HEB 4:7" />Waŋa iyi ki yiŋ ndi Arik ne nyak bɛr nuŋ, ndi azhɔi te,&lt;&lt;Aliŋ.&gt;&gt; Ase tetɛk ayi gayir Arik ane lɛ ilɛ kǝŋe ne anu akɛ Doda ndi icɛr ne di:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 4:7">&lt;&lt;Izhin te wɔ lɛ kɛ Arik aliŋe, kǝr zhin bǝ kpa asusun amin ba.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="HEB 4:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="HEB 4:8" />Ate yi ndi Jeshuwa ne nek aneshir sɔŋ sik iyiŋ ndi Arik ane kpai aŋyak, Arik bai bena lɛ ne atu ayi bɛr nuŋ ba. <verse eid="HEB 4:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="HEB 4:9" />Ndi iyi amɛ, fena, ana shuzhi aner abɛ Arik te bɛ sɔŋ asik ndi Arik ne sɔŋ asik ne bɛr yi taŋgba. <verse eid="HEB 4:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="HEB 4:10" />Fe abaŋ ndi ne ta sɔŋ sik yuŋɔ ndi Arik ne kpai aŋyak atei sɔŋ asik ne ndum men, ir keŋ ndi Arik ne sɔŋ asik ne ndum maa. <verse eid="HEB 4:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="HEB 4:11" />Neme, ta bǝ tsi kli te nek atu mɔr te ta sɔŋ kɛ sik yuŋɔ, te kǝr inuŋ ne miŋ mɔr abɛ zhaku ndi ayuŋɔ nena ne kyak tanyɛme men. <verse eid="HEB 4:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="HEB 4:12" />Tǝ ilɛ kɛ Arik iyi tsitsir te na ndum, te na li naŋ anzigba akɛ li agar ayaa. Iyir te gar amkpa waŋ ndi susun ben izhu abiŋ, ne amkpa awaŋ ndi alambur abiŋ. Itǝ kiki yi bubu ben lǝlɛ yi susun ambuk. <verse eid="HEB 4:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="HEB 4:13" />Ba ikinuŋ iyi suyir ne ti kɛ Arik ba; kɔte nii iyi andala tena kam kukur ndende ne ayi amaa. Ayi Wa ndi ne na gɔŋmimi ta tei blau kiki yi na mɔr bɔbɔk.<verse eid="HEB 4:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesɔ Ngɔŋ ne na ndum Arik</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="HEB 4:14" />Neme, tabǝ klɛ mgbamgbaŋ ne tanyɛme mɔr. Tǝ tayi ne Ŋgɔŋ ne na ndum Arik iwaŋ ndi ne ka kɔmɔ ben Arik, Yesɔ Izu Arik. <verse eid="HEB 4:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="HEB 4:15" />Ngɔŋ amɔr ne na ndum Arik ba yi waŋ ndi ayaŋ wɔ lɔ susun ne klu aŋin mɔr ba. Ba yi amɛ ankyak ba, tayi ne Ŋgɔŋ ne na ndum Arik iwaŋ ndi ne tsa ru ne nkuŋkɔŋ bɔbɔk ndi ta yime, ama bane na lalɛ ba. <verse eid="HEB 4:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="HEB 4:16" />Duŋ tabǝ yi ne zhɔk susun, fe, te gbahir ne mben ye Arik, nena didik maa. Ne mwɔ ta tei ta lɔ susun tena yik ki didik te bɛ lɔk tama ne mkpaŋ kɛ wɔb.<verse eid="HEB 4:16" /></para>
  <chapter eid="HEB 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="HEB 5" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="HEB 5:1" />Kɔte ngɔŋ tawa ne na ndum kɛ Arik ayi hria iye aneshir amaa ne tunu te abɛ yi ayi amɔr ne naa Arik ndum, te abɛ nek kiki bǝn tsik baŋ yi na zumimin mɔr. <verse eid="HEB 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="HEB 5:2" />Tǝ iwa maayi ayi ne klu aŋin ne nkuŋkɔŋ tetɛk, abɛ yi ne zǝ tu zhɔk ben abɛ yaŋ zhi te na cɔk. <verse eid="HEB 5:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="HEB 5:3" />Ndi iwa maayi ayi ne klu aŋin, ba atei tsik baŋ ne atu ayi zumimin ye aneshir amaa ankyak ba ama te vuŋ iyi tu maa.<verse eid="HEB 5:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="HEB 5:4" />Ba nuŋ ahria tu maa te wa abɛ yi ngɔŋ ne na ndum Arik ba. Ayi Arik wa kiki maa zhɔu ineshire tǝ bɛ yi ngɔŋ ne na ndum amaa ndi Aruna ne yime. <verse eid="HEB 5:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="HEB 5:5" />Ne ankɔŋ azhiin awaŋa, kristi ba ne nek tu maa ngɔŋ te abɛ yi ngɔŋ nena ndum Arik ba. Fena Arik ne diu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 5:5">&lt;&lt;Uyi Izu muŋ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 5:5">Aliŋe Myi Tetɛɛ ami.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="HEB 5:5" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="HEB 5:6" />Ne na di ne amkpa nuŋ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 5:6">&lt;&lt;Utei yi ngɔŋ ne na ndum kɛ Arik yaŋ klɛtu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 5:6">Ne ankɔŋ ayi Mecizedek.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="HEB 5:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="HEB 5:7" />Nǝ mkpaŋ keŋ ndi Yesɔ ne yi ne gɔŋmimi, ne ben Arik tena gliu izhin maa ne kɔr ngɔŋ te zhin ayi ashur iwaŋ ndi atei tau azhɔk ne kuh, ne wɔu ne nek tu maa. <verse eid="HEB 5:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="HEB 5:8" />Ama ne yi Izu Arik, ne yi ne nek tu ne yik iyah maa. <verse eid="HEB 5:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="HEB 5:9" />Ndi ne duŋu ashaga, ne yi ankɔŋ ane yik ta zhɔk iyi yaŋ klɛtu ben abaŋ ndi azǝ lɛ maa <verse eid="HEB 5:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="HEB 5:10" />ankyak Arik ne duŋu ayi ngɔŋ ne ndum kɛ Arik, ne atu yi Mecizedek.<verse eid="HEB 5:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Igbaŋ atɔŋ ne kyak tanyɛme</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="HEB 5:11" />Ta yi ne ikiki tetɛk yi bla ne atu ayi iki yiŋɛ, ama itei lɔ bla zhin, te izhin yi klu aŋin ne zhi. <verse eid="HEB 5:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="HEB 5:12" />Mkpaŋ ne yime tetɛk te izhin ibǝyi abɛ tsar, neme izhin wɔb te inuŋ abɛ tsar zhin ikiki yi tanyɛme ben lɛ kɛ Arik. Izhin wɔb amayak, bai ikili kpamkpak ba! <verse eid="HEB 5:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="HEB 5:13" />Iwaŋ ndi asɔ amayak, anak ari yi ivǝvǝn, ba ne zen acɛ ne zhi ki didik bǝn mimin ba. <verse eid="HEB 5:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="HEB 5:14" />Ikili kpamkpak, ne gar nuŋ, iyi acicɛ, ne na amɛ itei duŋ ba zhi ina didik bǝn ina mimin.<verse eid="HEB 5:14" /></para>
  <chapter eid="HEB 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="HEB 6" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="HEB 6:1" />Neme, duŋ tabǝ zǝ iki yiŋ ndi ne tsar ta neyi ne atu ayi Yesɔ. Ta neka kuti tsar zhin iki didik ndi ba tane tsar zhin ne yi ba. kǝr tabǝ na zǝ itsar yi yik ayi te igli neshir gar iku ta bǝ tanyɛme ben Arik ne susun amɔr. <verse eid="HEB 6:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="HEB 6:2" />Tane ka men tsar zhin ne atu ayi su aneshir kaaŋkaŋ ne sak kɛ Yesɔ ben saak aneshir aŋɔk. Izhin ne zhi ilɛ kɛ lɛk aneshir ne bɛ ben ŋas iyi klɛtu. Neme tabǝ zǝ itsar didik. <verse eid="HEB 6:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="HEB 6:3" />Ta tei li ti, ndi Arik ate tanyɛme. <verse eid="HEB 6:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="HEB 6:4" />Abaŋ ndi neka ta lɛ kɛ Arik tǝ nɛ zhaku ai na kikin te gli ba aŋur akama te bɛ duŋ zumimin?. Ne ka yik didik kɛ Arik tena ta Izhu Tsetser; <verse eid="HEB 6:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="HEB 6:5" />ne zhi te lɛ kɛ Arik iyi didik ben mgbyamgbyaŋ ne ikab kɛ nyɛ, <verse eid="HEB 6:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="HEB 6:6" />fe azizaŋa aba ne tu men ne kyak tanyɛme! Itei lɔmɔ te bɛ ana gli ba aŋur akam ne ankɔŋ ayou Arik atara ana kpaŋ Yesɔ tena zhɔ gu shisha ne ti kɛ aneshir. <verse eid="HEB 6:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="HEB 6:7" />Arik nɛ nǝk imimi anu adidik iyiŋ ndi gbur amalu ndi aku amkpamkpaŋ te duŋ bǝbǝ ki itɔ te nek mgbyaŋ ben abɛ lɔn anu adidik. <verse eid="HEB 6:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="HEB 6:8" />Ama ate yi ndi ncoŋ ben ishub itɔ ne mimi me, ba yi didik ba. Arik atei nege anu amimin itei gɔŋ.<verse eid="HEB 6:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="HEB 6:9" />Ama, akpaamuŋ, atei ndi ta lɛ amɛ bata ne yaŋ zhi zhin ba. Izhin ne zhi iki yiŋ ndi yi didik iyi ita zhɔk Arik. <verse eid="HEB 6:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="HEB 6:10" />Arik ayi nena iki didik ba tei ŋur asuk ne ndum didik kɛ na min ben ir keŋ ndi izhin ne tanyɛme bǝn abɔu ben ndum keŋ ndi nena kɛ kukub ben azizaŋa. <verse eid="HEB 6:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="HEB 6:11" />Ta wɔb te kɔte ŋɔwa abɛ gli nek tu maa gar klɛtu, te izhin bǝ yik iki yiŋ ndi izhin shur ayime neyi. <verse eid="HEB 6:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="HEB 6:12" />Ba ta wɔb te inuŋ abɛyi ne te ankɔ ba, ama izhin bǝ yi ndi abaŋ ndi ne ta iki shur ayi men ne tanyɛme yi susun ben vuŋ susun, te bɛ ta iki iyiŋ ndi Arik ne kpai aŋyak.<verse eid="HEB 6:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ikpa nyak iye Arik</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="HEB 6:13" />Ndi Arik ne kpa ilɛ aŋyak ben Ibrai, ne she arim iwa atei na iki yiŋ ndi wa ne akpai aŋyak. Tǝ ine naŋu ana yime ba, ne she arim ne sak maa. <verse eid="HEB 6:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="HEB 6:14" />Arik ne di, &lt;&lt;Mne mkpaŋ nyagu te ndi M tei nǝgu anu adidik te nek nga ŋli mi iki tetɛk.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="HEB 6:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="HEB 6:15" />Neme Ibrai ne vuŋ susun, te ta iki yiŋ ndi Arik ne kpai anyagu. <verse eid="HEB 6:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="HEB 6:16" />Aneshir ate sherim, asherim me ne sak keŋ ndi iyi ŋgɔŋ inaŋ ba, arim ayiŋɛ aduŋ atam aklɛ. <verse eid="HEB 6:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="HEB 6:17" />Tǝ abaŋ ndi ai bɛ ta iki yiŋ ndi Arik ne kpai aŋyak ba, Arik ne duŋ ba zhi te iwa batei sen anu ba; te sherim ne lɛ kɛ kpa nyak maa. <verse eid="HEB 6:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="HEB 6:18" />Waŋa ai ikiki yaa, ndi batei sen ba te Arik ba timu ba. Itaba abaŋ ndi ta ne lieru ne atu maa ta bǝ tsi kli mgbamgbaŋ te shur ayi mɔr. <verse eid="HEB 6:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="HEB 6:19" />Ishur ayi mɔr yiŋɛ ai yi iyi mgbyamgbyaŋ mɔr. Ita zub tena ta aneshir shur, te zǝ ŋa anklu kɛ miŋ Akabaŋkɔŋ ane gbarshu ndi Arik ayime. <verse eid="HEB 6:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="HEB 6:20" />Yesɔ ne ka kuuta ti agar amɔ ne atu amɔr, te yi ŋgɔŋ ne na ndum Arik yaŋ klɛtu, ndi nkɔŋ kɛ Macizede.<verse eid="HEB 6:20" /></para>
  <chapter eid="HEB 6" />
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="HEB 7" />
  <para style="s">Itum Macizede</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="HEB 7:1" />Macizede Itum ne Salɛm bǝn ngɔŋ ne na ndum Arik. Ndi Ibrai ne sɔŋ aŋyak are ikum ndi ne li atum amɛ nas ne kum, Macizede ne mla bǝn abɔu te sagu ŋɔk didik, <verse eid="HEB 7:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="HEB 7:2" />ankyak Ibrai ne nǝgu izhiin ne miŋ kɛ wur ne bɔbɔk iki yiŋ ndi wa ayime neyi. (Ne kuti isak kɛ Macizede iyi &lt;&lt;Itum ne yi tsetser&gt;&gt;; tena yi Itum ne Salɛm, nena zhɔu te &lt;&lt;Itum ne sik susun&gt;&gt;.) <verse eid="HEB 7:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="HEB 7:3" />Macizede ba ne yi ne Tetɛɛ ben iyah ben nga ŋli ba; ba ne cɛr ikinuŋ ne atu yi ŋliu kɔ iku ba. Ayi ndi Izu Arik; ayi ne na ndum kɛ yaŋ klɛtu.<verse eid="HEB 7:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="HEB 7:4" />Ubǝ tɔ, te yik, ir keŋ ndi neyi ngɔŋ: Ibrai ne tu maa, ndi ayi ntsǝntsǝm amɔr, ne nǝgu izhiin ne miŋ kɛ wur kɛ iki yiŋ ndi wa ne yigǝ ne ikum. <verse eid="HEB 7:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="HEB 7:5" />Fe abaŋ ndi ayi ŋli kɛ Lawi ndi aye aba na ndum kɛ Arik ne kpa lɛ aŋyak te di abɛ ta izhiin ne miŋ kɛ wur ben aneshir abɛ Isrela, ndi aner amen, ndi anayi ŋli kɛ Ibrai. <verse eid="HEB 7:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="HEB 7:6" />Macizede bai nga ŋli kɛ Lawi ba, ama ne ta izhiin ben Ibrai te nǝgu anu didik, iwaŋ ndi ayi ne ilɛ kɛ kpa nyak bǝn Arik. <verse eid="HEB 7:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="HEB 7:7" />Bai iki te atam ba ngɔŋ anǝk vǝtsɔb anu didik. <verse eid="HEB 7:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="HEB 7:8" />Bǝn abɛ na ndum kɛ Arik abɛ kuh aba ata izhiin ne miŋ kɛ wur; ama bǝn Macizede abɛyi atsitsir aba ata izhiin ne min kɛ wur, ir keŋ ndi ilɛ kɛ Arik ne bla. <verse eid="HEB 7:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="HEB 7:9" />Amɛ, atei di, Lawi waŋ ndi ata zhiin ne miŋ kɛ wur, nɛ nǝk Ibrai izhiin ne miŋ kɛ wur. <verse eid="HEB 7:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="HEB 7:10" />Bane zen aŋli Lawi ba, ama ne lɛ ne miŋ ne kɛ atsintsim amaa, Macizede ne mla kpa bǝn Ibrai.<verse eid="HEB 7:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="HEB 7:11" />Aneyi ne atu aye ne Lawi abɛ na ndum kɛ Arik ne nek Yahudawa ilɛ kɛ kpa nyak. Neme, abɛdi ndum kɛ ane Lawi nɛ nǝk abɛ na ndum kɛ Arik ne shaga, bai abɛ duŋ nena ndum kɛ Arik nuŋ amunoru ba, iwaŋ ndi ayi ne nkɔŋ kɛ abɛ na Arik ndum ndi ai Macizede, bai Aruna ba. <verse eid="HEB 7:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="HEB 7:12" />Ate yi ndi ate sen nkɔŋ kɛ abɛ na ndum kɛ Arik, ai bɛ na sen ilɛ kɛ kpa nyak. <verse eid="HEB 7:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="HEB 7:13" />Arik amɔr iwaŋ ndi alɛlɛ ne atu amaa, ba yi nga ŋli kɛ ane Lawi ba, ba nuŋ ne nga ŋli mǝne ne na ndum kɛ Arik ba. <verse eid="HEB 7:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="HEB 7:14" />Ane zhi tedi ne ŋliu ne nga kɛ Yahuza; Musa ba ne bla ba azhɔgo ndi ne lɛ ne atu abɛ na ndum Arik ba.<verse eid="HEB 7:14" /></para>
  <para style="s">Nǝ na ndum Arik nuŋ ndi Macizede</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="HEB 7:15" />Iyiŋɛ ne yi ndende, ine na ndum Arik nuŋ kaaŋkaŋ ne munoru; ndi ayi ndi Macizede. <verse eid="HEB 7:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="HEB 7:16" />Ne yi ne na ndum kɛ Arik, ba ne zǝ nkɔŋ ben ilɛ kɛ aneshir ba, ama mgbyamgbyaŋ kɛ ivli keŋ ndi ba yi ne klɛtu ba. <verse eid="HEB 7:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="HEB 7:17" />Tǝ ilɛ kɛ Arik idi, &lt;&lt;Utei yi ne na ndum kɛ Arik yaŋ klɛtu, ndi Macizede.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="HEB 7:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="HEB 7:18" />Lǝlɛ yi kpa nyak yi kukub ne duŋǝ, ba yi ne mgbyamgbyaŋ ba tena yi iki sha. <verse eid="HEB 7:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="HEB 7:19" />Tǝ icɛr yi Musa ba ne duŋ ikinuŋ ishaga ba. Azizaŋa nɛ nǝk ta ishur ayi didik ndi ta nyɛ gbahir ben Arik.<verse eid="HEB 7:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="HEB 7:20" />Neme, Arik nena she arim. Anuŋ abaŋ ndi aye abɛ na ndum kɛ Arik bane she ba arim ba. <verse eid="HEB 7:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="HEB 7:21" />Ama Yesɔ neyi nena ndum kɛ Arik ndi Arik ne sheu arim te diu:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 7:21">&lt;&lt;Arik ne kpa nyak</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 7:21">Batei na rige ashur ba;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 7:21">Utei yi nena ndum kɛ Arik yaŋ klɛtu.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="HEB 7:21" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="HEB 7:22" />Ir kaaŋkaŋ yiŋɛ, fe, ne duŋ Yesɔ ayi ne ankɔŋ ane ilɛ kɛ kpa nyak didik.<verse eid="HEB 7:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="HEB 7:23" />Waŋa anayi ikinuŋ kaaŋkaŋ: abɛ na ndum kɛ Arik ne yime tetɛk, te iku ne yar ba na ndum mǝne. <verse eid="HEB 7:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="HEB 7:24" />Ama Yesɔ ayime yaŋ klɛtu, ndum maa ben ngɔŋ maa bane baŋ kɛ anǝk inuŋ ba. <verse eid="HEB 7:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="HEB 7:25" />Fe ayi ne mgbyamgbyaŋ, kɔte mkpaŋ takɛ, te abɛ ta abaŋ ndi anyɛ ben Arik ne atu maa azhɔk, te Iwa ayime yaŋ klɛtu te abɛ ben ba Arik.<verse eid="HEB 7:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="HEB 7:26" />Yesɔ, wa, ayi ngɔŋ nena ndum kɛ Arik ndi anaa ta kiki bɔbɔk ndi ta wɔ bǝ. Ayi tsetser; ba yi ne la lɛ bǝn zumimin ba; ane amene ahriau atibe bǝn abɛ na zumimin te lɛgu agli akɔmɔ ne shu. <verse eid="HEB 7:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="HEB 7:27" />Ba yi ndi nki abɛ na ndum Arik ba; ba wɔb te abɛ tsik ibaŋ kɔte bɛr tayi ne atu ayi na zumimin maa bǝn nki aneshir ba. Ne tsik ibaŋ mkpaŋ zhiin ankyak, ndi nɛ nǝk itu maa. <verse eid="HEB 7:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="HEB 7:28" />Icɛr yi Musa ne hria anuŋ abaŋ ndi aklu anyɛ te abɛ yi angɔŋgɔŋ abɛ na ndum kɛ Arik; ama ikpa nyak yi Arik bǝn sherim, ndi ne nyɛ ne igɔŋ cɛr yi Musa, ne hria Izu maa te duŋu ashaga iyaŋ klɛtu.<verse eid="HEB 7:28" /></para>
  <chapter eid="HEB 7" />
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="HEB 8" />
  <para style="s">Yesɔ ŋgon amɔr ne na ndum Arik</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="HEB 8:1" />Neme ikiyiŋ ndi ta di tayi ne ŋgon ne na ndum kɛ Arik, iwaŋ ndi akɔ sɔŋ ne ŋɔk li ne mben yi Arik ne gbarshu. <verse eid="HEB 8:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="HEB 8:2" />Ana ndum kɛ ngɔŋ abɛ na ndum Arik ne amkpa ne tsetser, ne Akabaŋkɔŋ awaŋ ndi Arik ne nau aŋyak, bai ineshir ba.<verse eid="HEB 8:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="HEB 8:3" />Kɔte ngɔŋ tawa ndi ana ndum kɛ Arik ne hriau te abɛ tsik Arik ibaŋ yi Awuwu, fe ngɔŋ amɔr ne na ndum Arik ayi ne iki yiŋ ndi iwa maayi atei tsik ibaŋa neyi. <verse eid="HEB 8:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="HEB 8:4" />Abɛ di ne yi ne gɔŋmimi, bai abɛ yi nena ndum kɛ Arik ba, te abɛ na ndum kɛ Arik ne yime abaŋ ndi atsik ibaŋ ndi Yahudawa awɔb. <verse eid="HEB 8:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="HEB 8:5" />Ana ndum ne Akaba awaŋ ndi ayi izhu yi ikiki ndi iyi ne gbarshu. Iyi anenen ndi mkpaŋ kɛ Musa. Ndi ne tei te Ibur kɛ Arik, Arik ne diu, &lt;&lt;Ubɛ nak na kɛ ir keŋ ndi ne tsa ru ne tu gbu.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="HEB 8:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="HEB 8:6" />Ama azizaŋa, Arik ne Yesɔ ndum keŋ ndi inaŋ men, ndi ilɛ keŋ ndi Arik ne kpa kɛ aŋyak iwa ben aneshir amaa ndi irɛ, te ayi lɛ kɛ kpa nyak kɛ ikiki didik.<verse eid="HEB 8:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="HEB 8:7" />Abɛ di ilɛ kɛ kpa nyak kɛ kuti ne yi anenen bai abɛ na kpa kɛ Mkpaŋ kɛ yaa aŋyak ba. <verse eid="HEB 8:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="HEB 8:8" />Ama Arik neyik klu aŋin ben aner amaa ndi ne di:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 8:8">&lt;&lt;Arik adi, iber nyɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 8:8">Ndi M tei mkpaŋ ilɛ yayas nyak ben aneshir abɛ Isrela ben aneshir abɛ Yahuza.<verse eid="HEB 8:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="HEB 8:9" />Batei yi ndi ikpa nyak yiŋ ndi Mne ntai bǝn atsǝntsǝm amen ba</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 8:9">Ne iber yiŋ ndi Mne vu ba ne ŋɔk muŋ te ngli ba rumɔ ne Masar.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 8:9">Bane zǝ ilɛ kɛ kpa nyak muŋ ben abɛba ba,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 8:9">Neme, bam ne kam tɔ ba ba.<verse eid="HEB 8:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="HEB 8:10" />Azizaŋa, waŋa ai lɛ kǝŋ ndi M tei mkpaŋ kǝ nyak bǝn aneshir abǝ Isrela</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 8:10">Arik adi, ne iber yi nyɛ:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 8:10">M tei tib ilɛ muŋ nyak ne alambur tu amen</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 8:10">Tena ncɛr kɛ ne asusun amen:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 8:10">M tei yi Arik amen,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 8:10">Aba atei na yi aneshir amuŋ.<verse eid="HEB 8:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="HEB 8:11" />Ba nuŋ ne miŋ mǝne ndi atei tsar kpa maa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 8:11">Ka inuŋ ai tsar zumen, te di, &lt;Ubɛ zhi Arik.&gt;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 8:11">Tǝ bɔbɔk mǝne atei zhim, ivuŋ rɛ amuotsɔtsɔb ben te gar ben angɔŋgɔŋ.<verse eid="HEB 8:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="HEB 8:12" />M tei zuk ba shur ne zumimin men</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 8:12">Bam tei na shuzhi la lɛ men ba.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="HEB 8:12" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="HEB 8:13" />Ndi Arik ne lɛ ilɛ kɛ kpa nyak yayas, neka duŋ yi kuti me ibǝ yi cice; neme bɔbɔk iki yiŋ ndi ne ka cɔkla itei dɔ batei na yigǝ ba.<verse eid="HEB 8:13" /></para>
  <chapter eid="HEB 8" />
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="HEB 9" />
  <para style="s">Iziku Arik iyi Gbarshu bǝn Goŋmimi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="HEB 9:1" />Ikpa yak yi kuti iyi ne nkunkɔŋ yi zǝkur Arik bǝn mkpǝmkpa yi bǝn Arik. <verse eid="HEB 9:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="HEB 9:2" />Ne na Ibur, ne na amkpa nuŋ ne abɛm ndi azhɔu te amkpa tsetser. Nǝ amkpama ne yak iki laŋ lu ben Tebur ndi ne sak borodi kɛ nek Arik. <verse eid="HEB 9:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="HEB 9:3" />Nǝ ŋɔk lablɛ kɛ yaa Ibur iyime ndi azho kɛ te amkpa ne yi tsetser. <verse eid="HEB 9:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="HEB 9:4" />Nǝ miŋe ne na amkpa ne ŋɔk anyɛ ane yemgbɔ ane zineriya bǝn akpati ane ikiki yi kpa yak ndi ne ku ne agɔŋ ari ne zineriya ndi Manna iyi ne miŋe, Mkpɔk ki kɛ tɔ kɛ Haruna, mkpaŋ me yaa ndi ne cɛr ilɛ kɛ kpa yak na yi ne miŋe. <verse eid="HEB 9:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="HEB 9:5" />Nǝ itu Akpati me ikiki iyi yi ne amgba kɛ sɔŋɔ ndi ayi ŋgon kɛ Arik, ne bu amgba amen ashak amkpa ndi ne zuk zumimin yi aneshir shur. Ama azizaŋa bai mkpaŋ kɛ blaa zhin kiki bɔbɔk ba.<verse eid="HEB 9:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="HEB 9:6" />Waŋa ai ir keŋ ndi ne na ikiki yiŋɛ ayak. Abɛ na ndum kɛ Arik atei yir amkpa kuti ne Bur kɔte bɛr tayi te na ndum men, <verse eid="HEB 9:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="HEB 9:7" />ama anak ŋgon ne abɛ na ndum kɛ Arik ayir imiŋ Bur, te na ndum mkpaŋ zhiin ne se. Abaŋ azhizhi ndi ne tsik Arik ibaŋ ne atu maa ben zumimin yiŋ ndi aneshir nai ndi bane zhi te aba ne na zumimin ba. <verse eid="HEB 9:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="HEB 9:8" />Izhu Tsetser ne tsar ndende ir keŋ ndi ankɔŋ ane amkpa ane Tsetser bane zen abuu ba te ibur kɛ abɛm inak ri klikli adidik. <verse eid="HEB 9:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="HEB 9:9" />Waŋa ayi iki yiŋ ndi ne nai te abɛ gbaŋ atɔŋ aner abɛ kpaŋ kǝkɛnɛ. Iyiŋɛ ne tsar te itsik Arik ibaŋ yi inarum batei duŋ susun aneshir iyi tsetser ba, <verse eid="HEB 9:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="HEB 9:10" />te inak yi azhizhi, iso ben ina igyaŋ kaŋkaŋ. Waŋa anak yi nkuŋkɔŋ yi abɛm ankyak, yiŋ ndi yime se Arik ne ana nkuŋkɔŋ nuŋ yayas.<verse eid="HEB 9:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="HEB 9:11" />Ama Kristi ne ai ka nyɛ teyi Ŋgon ne na ndum kɛ Arik ine na kiki didik ndi ne men yime. Ibur keŋ ndi ne na ndum ne naŋ anki Aburɔ te na yi tsetser; bai Ibur keŋ ndi neshir ne na kɛ ne aŋɔk amaa ba, ndi ba yi ne miŋ kiki yiŋ ndi ne nai ne Goŋmimi ba. <verse eid="HEB 9:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="HEB 9:12" />Yesɔ ne yir Ibur o mkpaŋ zhiin ankyak ne miŋ amkpa ne yi tsetser, bane baŋ azhizhi wuwu ben Nklu te tsik ibaŋa ba; ama, ne baŋ azhizhi amaa te ta ta shur. <verse eid="HEB 9:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="HEB 9:13" />Azhizhi awuwu ben Alandɔŋ alulum ben ntɔŋ ivǝvǝn alandɔŋ ayi aneshir abaŋ ndi ne na zumimin, iduŋ ba ayi tsetser ne kpa. <verse eid="HEB 9:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="HEB 9:14" />Atei yi ndi ai ilɛ didik, fe te azhizhi ayi kristi ndi ne shuru ndi ayi tsetser! Nǝ Izhu iyi yaŋ klɛtu ne nek Arik tu maa ibaŋ yi tsetser. Azhizhi amaa atei ŋla lǝlɛ yi susun amɔr ne zǝ Arik ne ankɔŋ awaŋ ndi bai tsetser ba, te ta bɛ zǝ Arik awaŋ ndi avli.<verse eid="HEB 9:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="HEB 9:15" />Neme Kristi ai wa ne kpa ilɛ yayas aŋyak, te abaŋ ndi Arik ne zhɔ ba abɛ ta anu adidik ben Arik ndi ne kpai aŋyak. Iyiŋɛ tei te te inuŋ ne ku te ta aneshir ashur ne na zumimin men ndi ikpa nyak yi kuti ne na ndum.<verse eid="HEB 9:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="HEB 9:16" />Nǝ atu ayi cɛr yak se ne yik iner ne cɛrǝ ne ku baliŋ, <verse eid="HEB 9:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="HEB 9:17" />te icɛr yak bai ikinuŋ ba ndi ner ne cɛrǝ bate azǝne ku ba, icɛre itei na ndum ndi iner ne cɛrǝ te ku. <verse eid="HEB 9:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="HEB 9:18" />Waŋa ayi iki yiŋ ndi ikpa yak yi kuti ne na ndum ne shur azhizhi. <verse eid="HEB 9:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="HEB 9:19" />Nǝ kuti, Musa ne bla aneshir ikpa nyak yiŋ ndi iyi ne cɛr maa. Ankyak ne baŋ azhizhi awuwu bǝn alandɔŋ alulum te biŋu ne amashir, te a mesu ashur ne mplɛ cɛr kɛ Musa fe bɔbɔk aneshir, ne na ndum ne amgba kuŋkun bǝn mfumfuk wuwu sɛsen. <verse eid="HEB 9:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="HEB 9:20" />Musa di, &lt;&lt;Waŋa ayi azhizhi ane kpa yak yiŋ ndi ne di izhin bɛ zei.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="HEB 9:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="HEB 9:21" />Ne ankɔŋ azhiin awaŋa Musa ne ames azhizhi ashur ne ibur kɛ yi tsetser ben ikiki bɔbɔk yiŋ ndi ana ndum neyi te ben Arik. <verse eid="HEB 9:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="HEB 9:22" />Neme, ne cɛr yi Musa ne duŋ ikiki bɔbɔk yi tsetser ne azhizhi, fe azuk ineshir azhɔk ne zumimin maa ne ankɔŋ ane shur azhizhi.<verse eid="HEB 9:22" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesɔ ne shur azhizhi amaa te baŋ zumimin yi aneshir atibe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="HEB 9:23" />Ikiki yuŋ, ndi yi ir kɛ yi Gbarshu abɛ duŋǝ yi tsetser ne ankɔŋ azhiin awaŋa. ama ikiki yi shu iwɔb te abɛ duŋǝ yi tsetser iki yi tsik ibaŋ ndi inaŋ yiŋɛ. <verse eid="HEB 9:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="HEB 9:24" />Te Yesɔ bane yir amkpa ane yi tsetser ane na ne aŋɔk aneshir ba, ndi yi ir kɛ didige. Nǝ yuŋ akɔmɔ ne Gbarshu, ndi ne ru kli ne atu amɔr ne ti kɛ Arik. <verse eid="HEB 9:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="HEB 9:25" />Ngɔŋ ne na ndum kɛ Arik ne Yahudawa ayir amkpa ne yi tsetser ne se ne azhizhi inarum. Ama Kristi bane nek itu maa amkpaŋ tetɛk ba, <verse eid="HEB 9:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="HEB 9:26" />neme abɛ yik iyah amkpaŋ tetɛk ire na igɔŋmimi. Neme, ndi mkpaŋ bɔbɔk ne nyɛ klɛ, ne ru kli mkpaŋ zhiin ankyak, te abɛ baŋ zumimin atibe ne nek tu maa. <verse eid="HEB 9:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="HEB 9:27" />kɔte nŋɔwa atei ku mkpaŋ zhiin ankyak, fe Arik atei teu ambuk. <verse eid="HEB 9:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="HEB 9:28" />Ne ankɔŋ azhiin awaŋa Kristi ne tsik ibaŋ ne tu maa mkpaŋ izhiin ankyak te abaŋ zumimin aneshir tetɛk atibe. Atei ru kli mkpaŋ kɛ yaa, ba abɛ baŋ zumimin ba, ama abɛ ta abaŋ ndi akli aŋubu ashur.<verse eid="HEB 9:28" /></para>
  <chapter eid="HEB 9" />
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="HEB 10" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="HEB 10:1" />Ilɛ kɛ kpa nyak kɛ Yahudawa bane shaga ba bai ankɔŋ ane iki didik ba; ai iki sha bate Gli iki didik igli nyɛ ba. Ai ibaŋ yiŋɛ yi atsǝgǝ yaŋ klɛtu, atsik ibaŋ yiŋɛ kɔte se takɛ. Ilɛ kɛ kpa nyak kǝŋe itei na kikin te itsik ibaŋ yiŋɛ bɛ duŋ aneshir abaŋ ndi azǝ Arik abɛyi tsetser? <verse eid="HEB 10:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="HEB 10:2" />Ate yi ndi aner abaŋ ndi azǝ Arik neka duŋ ba ayi tsetser ne zumimin men, bate na dam atu men ne zumimin men ba, itsik baŋ yiŋɛ tei gburkli. <verse eid="HEB 10:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="HEB 10:3" />Ndi iyi amɛ, atsik ibaŋ yiŋɛ kɔte se takɛ te abɛ duŋ aneshir abɛ shu zumimin azhi. <verse eid="HEB 10:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="HEB 10:4" />Azhizhi Wuwu ben Alandɔŋ lulum batei zuk aneshir shur ne na zumimin men ba.<verse eid="HEB 10:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="HEB 10:5" />Nǝ yiŋɛ, ndi Kristi ne tei nyɛ gɔŋmimi, ne di Arik:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 10:5">&lt;&lt;Bau wɔb ibaŋ ben nek ikiki ba,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 10:5">Ama une na ikpa nyak me.<verse eid="HEB 10:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="HEB 10:6" />Bau tanyɛme ben inarum iyiŋ ndi ne goŋǝ ne amkpa ne tsik ibaŋ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 10:6">Ka ibaŋ yi baŋ zumimin tibɛ.<verse eid="HEB 10:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="HEB 10:7" />Fe mdi, &lt;Te nga waŋ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 10:7">M tei na iki yiŋ ndi uwɔbǝ, Arik,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 10:7">Ir keŋ ndi ne cɛr ne atu amuŋ ne ilɛ kɛ cɛr yi Musa.&gt;&gt;&gt;<verse eid="HEB 10:7" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="HEB 10:8" />Nǝ kuti ne di, &lt;&lt;Bau wɔb ka uyer ne tsik ibaŋ ben nek ikiki ka narum yiŋ ndi ne goŋǝ ne amkpa ne tsik baŋ ben ibaŋ yi baŋ zumimin yi aneshir.&gt;&gt; Ne bla amɛ ndi atuk ibaŋ yi ilɛ kɛ kpa nyak. <verse eid="HEB 10:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="HEB 10:9" />Fe adi, &lt;&lt;Te nga waŋ, Arik, M tei na iki yiŋ ndi uwɔbǝ.&gt;&gt; Ankyak Arik ne baŋ ilɛ kɛ tsik ibaŋ iyi kukub atibe te aŋyak Yesɔ ne amkpa ma. <verse eid="HEB 10:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="HEB 10:10" />Te Yesɔ Kristi ne na iki yiŋ ndi Arik awɔb te abɛ na, ta yi tsetser ndi Yesɔ ne nek ikpa maa mkpaŋ zhiin ankyak.<verse eid="HEB 10:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="HEB 10:11" />Kɔte ne na ndum Arik tawa ne Yahudawa ana ndum maa te na tsik ibaŋ amkpaŋ tetɛk; Ama ibaŋ yige ban zumimin tibɛ ba. <verse eid="HEB 10:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="HEB 10:12" />Neme, Kristi ne tsik ibaŋ yi ban zumimin tibɛ, itsik ibaŋ yige mkpaŋ zhin ankyak gar klɛtu, fe akɔ sɔŋ ne ŋɔk li kɛ Arik. <verse eid="HEB 10:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="HEB 10:13" />Ankyak ne ŋub se ndi Arik ne duŋu ajaŋ abaŋ ndi ate zor ben abɔu ne aza maa. <verse eid="HEB 10:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="HEB 10:14" />Ne tsik ibaŋ mkpaŋ zhin ankyak, ne duŋu ashaga yaŋ klɛtu te duŋ aneshir abɛ yi tsetser. <verse eid="HEB 10:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="HEB 10:15" />Aŋyak Izhu tsetser yi ayi amɔr. Ne kuti ne di, <verse eid="HEB 10:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="HEB 10:16" />&lt;&lt;Waŋa ai kpa nyak ndi mne tei ben abɛba, Arik adi: M tei duŋ icɛr yak muŋ ne asusun amen tena cɛrǝ ne alambur amen.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="HEB 10:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="HEB 10:17" />Fe Arik adi, bam te na shuzhi izumimin men ben ikiki yi na men ba. <verse eid="HEB 10:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="HEB 10:18" />Neme ndi zuk ba zhɔk ne ikiki yiŋɛ, ibaŋ yi ban zumimin ba na yime ba.<verse eid="HEB 10:18" /></para>
  <para style="s">Tabǝ nyɛ gbahir ben Arik</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="HEB 10:19" />Neme amunya, ta yi ne zhɔk kpa te yir amkpa ne tsetser ngɔŋ ne iku Yesɔ. <verse eid="HEB 10:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="HEB 10:20" />Ne bu ta ankɔŋ ayayas, ankɔŋ atsitsir, ne lablɛ ndi ai kpa maa. <verse eid="HEB 10:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="HEB 10:21" />Tayi ne ne na ndum kɛ Arik ngɔŋ ndi iwa agli ikɔb Arik. <verse eid="HEB 10:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="HEB 10:22" />Neme tabǝ nyɛ gbahir ben Arik ne susun didik ne tanyɛme, ne asusun ayiŋ ndi neka nai azhɔk tsetser ne iku azhizhi ben akpa ayiŋ ndi ne ŋlai ne amashir. <verse eid="HEB 10:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="HEB 10:23" />Tabǝ kli mgbamgbaŋ shur ayi ndi ta ne tanyɛme neyi, te ta ne tanyɛme ben Arik tena yak ikpa nyak maa. <verse eid="HEB 10:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="HEB 10:24" />Tabǝ na kam tɔ akpa amɔr, te na lɔk akpa amɔr tena nyɛr akpa tena na akpa mɔr iki didik. <verse eid="HEB 10:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="HEB 10:25" />Kǝr ta bɛ duŋ biŋ akpa mɔr ka, ndi anuŋ ana. Neme, tabǝ shɔk akpa mɔr ne lǝlɛ didik, te ta ne yik ibar yi isɔŋ te gbahir. <verse eid="HEB 10:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="HEB 10:26" />Te ba tena tsik ibaŋ yi baŋ zumimin gli tibɛ ba nta te na kam na zumimin ndi neka duŋ ta zhi didik. <verse eid="HEB 10:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="HEB 10:27" />Neme, tabǝ sɔŋ ŋub ambuk ayi sɔŋ nyɛ ne sisik ben ilu kɛ wu ngɔŋ ikeŋ ndi te ŋɔk abɛ kyak zǝ Arik! <verse eid="HEB 10:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="HEB 10:28" />Iwaŋ ndi ate kyak zi icɛr yi Musa atsǝgu aŋun yaŋ lɔ susun ndi aneshir ayaa kɔ naŋ te bla ikinuŋ ne tu maa. <verse eid="HEB 10:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="HEB 10:29" />Te itei yi kikin ben abaŋ ndi ne kyak Izu Arik? Ndi ne var azhizhi awaŋ ndi Arik ne kpa nyak ane duŋ ta yi tsetser ne zumimin? Ndi ne kyak izhu yi na iki didik? Tɔ ir iyah ngɔŋ yiŋ ndi atei nek ba neyi! <verse eid="HEB 10:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="HEB 10:30" />Te ta ne zhi iwaŋ ndi ne di, &lt;&lt;Nga M tei baŋ iki yiŋ ndi ne na neshir, M tei na nek neshir iki yiŋ ndi ne nai&gt;&gt;; Nena di, &lt;&lt;Arik atei te aneshir amaa ambuk.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="HEB 10:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="HEB 10:31" />Ai iki mimin ubɛ yir aŋɔk ayi Arik tsitsir! <verse eid="HEB 10:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="HEB 10:32" />Izhin bɛ shuzhi ndi ne yi Mkpaŋ kɛ gayir. Ne bǝn, ndi ilu kɛ Arik ne laŋ ku zhi, izhin ne yik iyah ne ikiki tetɛk, neme ta ne vuŋ susun Gli ne yik ya mɔr. <verse eid="HEB 10:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="HEB 10:33" />Nena yen zhin ne miŋ du aneshir ne kpaŋ nuŋ, ne kpaŋ nuŋ izhin ne wɔb kam zǝ abaŋ ndi ne naa ba amɛ. <verse eid="HEB 10:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="HEB 10:34" />Izhin ne wɔ lɔ susun kɛ abaŋ ndi ne ku ba ne jaru, ndi ne ta ikiki min bɔbɔk, izhin ne nyɛr ne vuŋ susun ne yaŋ ikiki min, te izhin ne zhi te izhin tei yik iki nuŋ yi naŋ iyuŋɔ shaan, ndi ba yi ne klɛ tu ba. <verse eid="HEB 10:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="HEB 10:35" />Kǝr zhin bɛ duŋ vuŋ susun Gli ba, te atei nek zhin idǝk ngɔŋ. <verse eid="HEB 10:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="HEB 10:36" />Izhin bɛ vuŋ susun, te izhin bɛ na iki yiŋ ndi Arik awɔbǝ te izhin bɛ ta iki yiŋ ndi ne di iwa atei nek zhin ne yi. <verse eid="HEB 10:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="HEB 10:37" />Fe ndi ilɛ kɛ Arik ne di, &lt;&lt;mkpaŋ ne dǝk watsɔb, iwaŋ ndi anyɛ atei nyɛ; batei ban mkpaŋ ba. <verse eid="HEB 10:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="HEB 10:38" />Aneshir tsetser muŋ, neme, ne tanyɛme yi susun atei yi atsitsir; ama inuŋ ate kam gɔŋ, bam tei wɔ men maa ba. <verse eid="HEB 10:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="HEB 10:39" />Bata aneshir abaŋ ndi ne kam ŋɔk te ku ba. Neme, itanyɛme mɔr itei ta ta zhɔk.<verse eid="HEB 10:39" /></para>
  <chapter eid="HEB 10" />
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="HEB 11" />
  <para style="s1">Itanyɛme ne susun</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="HEB 11:1" />Fe itanyɛme ne susun ayi ki ndi ne yi ta iyi shur ayi tena tanyɛme nǝ ki ndi bata ne yik ba. <verse eid="HEB 11:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="HEB 11:2" />Waŋa ayi ki ndi aner abɛ kukub ne tanyɛme men ne duŋ Arik ata ba.<verse eid="HEB 11:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="HEB 11:3" />Nǝ tanyɛme ta zhi te Arik nena kiki iyi gɔŋmimi ne lɛ maa, teduŋ iki ndi ne yigǝ bane nai ne yik ayi ba.<verse eid="HEB 11:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="HEB 11:4" />Nǝ tanyɛme iyi susun Abila ne tuk Arik amkpur adidik anaŋ ayou Ke ne. Nǝ tanyɛme ne di Abila ayi ner didik, ndi Arik ne lɛ ilɛ didik ne tu ayi tuk amkpur amaa. Neme ne tanyɛme ari zen lɛ, ndi neka ku.<verse eid="HEB 11:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="HEB 11:5" />Nǝ tanyɛme iyi susun ne duŋ abaŋ Enok tsitsir iyaŋ ku, ne yeme, Arik ne baŋu ne vli maa bane ku ba. Ndi Arik ne she baŋu, ne bla te ayi ner waŋ di ne naa Arik ki iyi rɛ. <verse eid="HEB 11:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="HEB 11:6" />Fena ne iyaŋ tanyɛme iyi susun bai tǝ te abɛ naa Arik ki iyi rɛ ba, te iwaŋ ndi ate nyɛ bene abɛ tanyɛme te Arik ayime te atei na nek abaŋ ndi awɔbu ne susun zhiin ai nǝk ba idǝk men.<verse eid="HEB 11:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="HEB 11:7" />Nǝ tanyɛme iyi susun ne duŋ Nuhu ne wɔ gbaŋ atɔŋ iye Arik netu kiki iyi nyɛ ndi bane yigǝ neyi ba, ne klu sǝsǝk iyi tsetser ne kpaŋ Igu ŋgɔŋ tǝ bɛ ta aner abɛ kɔmaa azhɔk. Nǝ tanyɛme maa ne zǝr gɔŋmimi teyi ita iyi abɛ na ki didik ndi ne nyɛ ne tanyɛme.<verse eid="HEB 11:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="HEB 11:8" />Nǝ tanyɛme iyi susun ne duŋ Ibrai ne wɔ ilɛ kɛ Arik ndi ne azhɔu tǝ bɛ duŋ kɔmaa te kɔmɔ ne ntun iyiŋ ndi Arik ne akpa aŋyak te iwa atei nǝgu. Ne duŋ ntun maa ne yaŋ zhi amkpa awaŋ ndi uwa gara. <verse eid="HEB 11:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="HEB 11:9" />Nǝ tanyɛme ne sɔŋ ndi icen ne ntun iyiŋ ndi Arik ne nǝgu. Ne sɔŋ ne abur, ir kɛ Ishaku ben Yakubu, aba aneta ir ki zhiin yiŋɛ ben Arik. <verse eid="HEB 11:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="HEB 11:10" />Ibrai anezen tɔ ka wa atei yik ntun iyiŋ ndi ne shur tanda teshe amei, iwaŋ ndi ne gli ira izhu iyi mɛ me aye Arik.<verse eid="HEB 11:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="HEB 11:11" />Nǝ tanyɛme iyi susun ne duŋ Ibrai neyi tetɛɛ, ndi ice neka vuŋu ŋgɔŋ te Saratu nɛ kana akam ase ayi ŋli amumun. Ne tanyɛme ben Arik te Gli itanyɛme maa. <verse eid="HEB 11:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="HEB 11:12" />Neme ibaŋ rɛ ben iner zhiin waŋa,<verse eid="HEB 11:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="HEB 11:13" />Aneshir abaŋa aneyi atsitsir ne tanyɛme iyi susun ndi ne ku. Bane ta kiki iyi kpa nyak ba; ne nak ayige tena tanyɛme neyi ire gbagbaŋ. Te gli tedi aba ayi acɛn ben acɛn ne gɔŋmimi. <verse eid="HEB 11:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="HEB 11:14" />Aner abɛ bla ir kiki yiŋɛ iduŋ ba abɛzhi tedi aba awɔb ntun iye atu amen. <verse eid="HEB 11:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="HEB 11:15" />atei ndi alɛ susun ikɛ ntun ndi ne duŋǝ, ai bɛ yi ne mkpaŋ kɛ di aba atei ŋur akam. <verse eid="HEB 11:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="HEB 11:16" />Ibǝyi amɛ, ne shur ayi te aba abɛ yik ntun didik, ntun iyi gbarshu. Ndi amɛ bane klu ishisha iye Arik te aba abɛ zhɔu te Arik amen ba, te nena ntun ngɔŋ aŋyak ba.<verse eid="HEB 11:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="HEB 11:17" />Nǝ tanyɛme iyi susun zhin ne duŋ Ibrai ne abaŋ izu maa Ishaku atuk amkpuro. Iwaŋ ndi ne ta ikpa nyak ane tei tuk amkpur ne izhiin amaa ben mgbyaŋ zu maa zhiin, <verse eid="HEB 11:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="HEB 11:18" />ne yeme Arik ne diu, &lt;&lt;Igar zǝ ben Ishaku te utei yik iŋle kɛ du ne kpa nyak muŋ.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="HEB 11:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="HEB 11:19" />Ibrai ne tanyɛme te Arik ayi ne mgbyamgbyaŋ kɛ lɛk Ishaku ne iku, ne bla nkanlɛ iyiŋɛ, Ibrai ne ta Ishaku aŋur akama ne ku.<verse eid="HEB 11:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="HEB 11:20" />Nǝ tanyɛme iyi susun Ishaku nɛ nǝk Yakubu ben Isuwa anu adidik ne sɔŋ kɛ gɔŋmimi.<verse eid="HEB 11:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="HEB 11:21" />Nǝ tanyɛme iyi susun Yakubu nɛ nǝk amun Yusuu anu adidik te ashe ku. Ne zhik aklɛ ne tu asanda ane tsǝn amaa te zǝ kuu Arik.<verse eid="HEB 11:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="HEB 11:22" />Nǝ tanyɛme iyi susun ne duŋ Yusuu, ndi mkpaŋ kǝ ku maa tate, ne abla ir tsǝn kɛ aner abɛ Isrela ire Masar ben nǝk ba iki ndi atei na ne kum maa.<verse eid="HEB 11:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="HEB 11:23" />Nǝ tanyɛme iyi susun ane tetɛɛ ben iya maa Musa ne baŋu asu ayir ihwa me tar ndi ne ŋliu, Ne yigu are nzak, fe ne akyak zǝ ilɛ kɛ bla itum ane Masar.<verse eid="HEB 11:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="HEB 11:24" />Nǝ tanyɛme iyi susun ne duŋ Musa, ndi neka flu, ne akyak tanyɛme tǝ bɛ azhɔ wa te izu iva itum. <verse eid="HEB 11:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="HEB 11:25" />Ne mtanyeme te iwa abɛ yik iyah ndi nki aneshir abɛ Arik inaŋ men kɛ lalɛ mkpaŋ. <verse eid="HEB 11:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="HEB 11:26" />Ne mtanyeme tǝ wa abɛ yik iyah netu ayi Kristi ndi ayi iki didik ŋgɔŋ inaŋ adudun ki ayi Masar, te iwa azǝn tɔ iti kɛ idǝk maa. <verse eid="HEB 11:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="HEB 11:27" />Nǝ tanyɛme iyi susun Musa ne ru ne Masar iyaŋ klu sisik iyi itum; te vuŋ kpa te duŋu neyik iwaŋ ndi ba ayigu ba. <verse eid="HEB 11:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="HEB 11:28" />Nǝ tanyɛme iyi susun ne gli inayi tuk glak ben shur azhizhi ne adɔŋkɔŋ, teduŋ Ineshar ayou Arik netu iku abɛ ŋun ŋli mla kɛ amunlum abɛ aner Isrela.<verse eid="HEB 11:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="HEB 11:29" />Nǝ tanyɛme iyi susun aneshire abɛ Isrela ne gara tsǝn te glɔ Inǝk ŋgɔŋ kluklu iyaŋ amashir; ndi aner abɛ Masar ne di aba atei na amɛ, amashir ne avuba adɔmɔ.<verse eid="HEB 11:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="HEB 11:30" />Nǝ tanyɛme iyi susun adampem ane ntun yi Jerikɔ ne zhaku, ndi aner abɛ Isrela ne goŋ ntuno ari ne iber me taŋgba.<verse eid="HEB 11:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="HEB 11:31" />Nǝ tanyɛme iyi susun Rahab ndi akur ben alulum, ne ta abɛ shar zhib tɔ ntun asuyir, bane ŋunu ben abɛ kyak wɔ lɛ kɛ Arik ba,<verse eid="HEB 11:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="HEB 11:32" />Tǝ aye nii iyi naŋ ndi Mtei na bla? Bam na yi ne mkpaŋ kɛ lɛ netu akɛ Gidiyon, Barak, Samson, Zhabta, Doda, Samula ben abɛ tɔ bla shar Arik, <verse eid="HEB 11:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="HEB 11:33" />abaŋ ndi ne tanyɛme iyi susun nɛ li ikum ne ntuntun, ne tsǝntsǝn didik, te yik iki ndi Arik ne kpai anyak. Iwaŋ ndi ne ku nunu yi ane zaki, <verse eid="HEB 11:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="HEB 11:34" />ubǝ rim ilu kǝ ta, te klu tibɛ nenu akɛ mashi; iwaŋ ndi iklu aŋin maa ne kam yi iklik; te iwa ne akam ayi ne mgbyamgbyaŋ ne kum ndi ane ta itsar klik maa ben abɛ kpaakpa ne ntuntun ye abɛm. <verse eid="HEB 11:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="HEB 11:35" />Nǝ tanyɛme iyi susun ne lɛk aner abɛ amba ne ku te akam ayi atsitsir. Anuŋ ne kyak ta izuk zhɔk, te ku ne miŋ kɛ yik iyah te abɛ ka lǝk ba ne vli kɛ rɛ. <verse eid="HEB 11:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="HEB 11:36" />Anuŋ ne pwar ba aŋyak tena milk ba tsik ne asǝsa, anuŋ ne kpa ba atabɛrbɛr te gli ba ate shur ne jaru. <verse eid="HEB 11:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="HEB 11:37" />Ne tyak ba ne mkpaŋ; anuŋ ne aŋar ba ne ada ashur aŋa yaa, ne yak anuŋ ne nzi. Ne goŋ ari te su akpaki ayi awuwu ben awanta, ijɔŋ, iyah, ben sak iyah. <verse eid="HEB 11:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="HEB 11:38" />Igɔŋmimi me bane rɛ ba ba. Ane tsǝn te ben adur ne ahwaŋ aŋgɔŋ, ben atugbu, ne ŋkɛ ben adudu ne mimi.<verse eid="HEB 11:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="HEB 11:39" />Aneshir abaŋa bɔbɔk ne nyɛr Arik ne tanyɛme iyi asusun amen, neme inuŋ ne miŋ mǝne bane ta iki ndi ne mǝne akpai aŋyak ba. <verse eid="HEB 11:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="HEB 11:40" />Arik ne na ikinuŋ iyi rɛ netu amɔr. Tǝ duŋ ben taba ai yik iklik mgbamgbaŋ.<verse eid="HEB 11:40" /></para>
  <chapter eid="HEB 11" />
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="HEB 12" />
  <para style="s1">Arik ayi Tetɛɛ amɔr</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="HEB 12:1" />Ndi iyeme, tayi ne ntsan aneshir abaŋ ndi neyik neyi amen ndi ne goŋ ta ari. Fena, duŋ tabǝ tyak kɔte nii iyi yar ta ben ilalɛ iyi gblik ta ne aza, te tabǝ klu te vuŋ kpa ne klu keŋ ndi nyak ta ne kǝ. <verse eid="HEB 12:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="HEB 12:2" />Duŋ tabǝ shur ayi ben Yesɔ, iwaŋ ndi itanyɛme iyi susun mɔr iyi ben abɔu rɛ zǝzaŋa gar klɛ tu. Iwa ndi itanyɛme yi susun mɔr iyi ben abɔu ire azizaŋa gar klɛ tu. Bane te ishisha ne kumɔ ba, te sɔŋ ne ŋɔk li ne mben iye Arik. <verse eid="HEB 12:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="HEB 12:3" />Shuzhi iki yiŋ ndi yire, ndi ne yik kyak iyi ire ben abɛ na zumimiŋ! Neme bane duŋ izhin sik kpa ba.<verse eid="HEB 12:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="HEB 12:4" />Nǝ zen gbaŋ min ne atu ayi zumimin, bane zen yir amkpa awaŋ ndi atei ŋunu ba. <verse eid="HEB 12:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="HEB 12:5" />Fe izhin ne ŋursuk te ilɛ kɛ nek didik idi izhin ndi amumun:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 12:5">&lt;&lt;Izu muŋ, duŋ baŋ ilɛ kɛ Ŋgɔŋ ne di bai iki lɔr ba,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 12:5">Fena duŋ na tun susun ba ndi ate vǝu ba.<verse eid="HEB 12:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="HEB 12:6" />Tǝ Arik Ŋgɔŋ atsaŋ abaŋ ndi anyɛr ba,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 12:6">Tena tsik ine lalɛ ndi ne atau ndi izu,&gt;&gt;<verse eid="HEB 12:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="HEB 12:7" />Vuŋ zhin susun ne miŋ kɛ iyah ndi izhin neyik igligli didik, Arik aglɛ zhin ndi amumun amaa. Tǝ izu tawa ndi tetɛɛ amaa bai tsǝgu kai? <verse eid="HEB 12:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="HEB 12:8" />Mba ate atsik zhin ba (ndi kɔte ŋɔwa abɛ yime ba), fena izhin ba yi iŋle didik ba, ne ŋlii zhin ne gli ne kɔb. <verse eid="HEB 12:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="HEB 12:9" />Nǝ naŋ yiŋɛ, bɔbɔk amɔrɔ aneshir tayi ne atetɛ abaŋ ndi atsik ta te tei na nǝk ba ŋgɔŋ men. Bai kana yi ndi tabǝ nek Tetɛɛ atu amɔr ne izhu ben ivli kɛ yaŋ klɛ! <verse eid="HEB 12:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="HEB 12:10" />Tetɛɛ mɔr atsik ta watsɔb ndi adi ne rɛ; ama Arik atsik ta tǝ bɛ anaa ta azhɔk anenen, te tabǝ gab ne tsetser maa. <verse eid="HEB 12:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="HEB 12:11" />Ba itsik nuŋ ndi ire ne mkpaŋa, ama ilɛn. Ndi ite gayir, fena, igli ki didik rumɔ iyi itsin didik ben isɔŋ kɛ sik ne atu aye abaŋ ndi ne yik irgli iyiŋɛ.<verse eid="HEB 12:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Gbaŋ atɔŋ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="HEB 12:12" />Fena, izhin bǝ lɛk aŋɔk ayi dǝk amin ben agbarum ayi ku sik amin. <verse eid="HEB 12:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="HEB 12:13" />&lt;&lt;Nak tsǝn anenen ne ankɔŋ ane nab,&gt;&gt; teduŋ aza min ayi dǝk, abɛ aŋur aklik<verse eid="HEB 12:13" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Gbaŋ atɔŋ ne kyak zǝ Arik</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="HEB 12:14" />Izhin bǝ klɛ mgbamgbaŋ te wɔb zhin isɔŋ kɛ sik ben aner bɔbɔk tena yine isɔŋ kɛ tsetser; te yaŋ yi tsetser inuŋ ba atei yik Arik ba. <verse eid="HEB 12:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="HEB 12:15" />Izhin bǝ tɔi ndi kǝr inuŋ abɛ suk yik ta zhɔk iye Arik ba ndi kǝr inuŋ abɛ yi ndi kuŋkun kɛ lik ibǝ tɔ te gbaŋ kinuŋ nyɛ kuu zhin te cɔk kiki tetɛk ila. <verse eid="HEB 12:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="HEB 12:16" />Kǝr inuŋ abɛ te bubu iye amba kɔ alulum teyi ne iyaŋ te sisik Arik ndi Isuwa, iwa ne atu ayi agbǝgba kili alɛb gadu maa iki yi ivǝn iyi kuti ŋli. <verse eid="HEB 12:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="HEB 12:17" />Nǝ goŋ iyiŋɛ, ndi izhin ne zhi, mkpaŋ keŋ ndi adi iwa ne wɔb ta gadu kɛ anu adidik amaa, ne yaru ma. Tǝ bane yik ankɔŋ ane sen iki ndi nenai ba, neme ne wɔb gadu mɔ ne amayi.<verse eid="HEB 12:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="HEB 12:18" />Ba zhin ne nyɛ ir keŋ ndi aner abɛ Isrela ane tsǝn ne ahwaŋ aŋgɔŋ, te sak aŋɔk awɔi ma, Igbu iyi Sinei izǝn ta lu; ibu bǝn ntsiŋ, bǝn nguŋgu; <verse eid="HEB 12:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="HEB 12:19" />ne vli nju, bǝn igu iyi kɔr. ne ben te kǝr aba bena wɔ ilɛ nuŋ ba, <verse eid="HEB 12:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="HEB 12:20" />te ba atei na gli ilɛ ndi ne di: &lt;&lt;Ate yi ndi kɔ ayi narum ne yaŋ kpa maa ne igbu mɔ atei tyagǝ aŋun.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="HEB 12:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="HEB 12:21" />Amkpama ane yi ane teduŋ Musa adi, &lt;&lt;Ikpa rǝm ne sisik.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="HEB 12:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="HEB 12:22" />Ama izhin ne nyɛ Gbu iyi Siyona, ne Urushelima ine shu, ai ntun ŋgɔŋ iye Arik tsitsir. Izhin ne nyɛ ne azhin ben azhin abɛ shar Arik ne amkpa ane biŋ aner te nyɛr, <verse eid="HEB 12:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="HEB 12:23" />izhin ne nyɛ aner abɛ kuti ŋli abɛ Arik, abaŋ ndi ne cɛr asak amene ne shu. Izhin ne nyɛ ben Arik, ine te aneshir ŋas bɔbɔk, bǝn izhu iyi aner abɛ na ki didik te shaga. <verse eid="HEB 12:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="HEB 12:24" />Izhin ne nyɛ ben Yesɔ ne angus akɛ kpa nyak yayas, bǝn ibwa azhizhi awaŋ ndi alɛ kpa nyaga rumɔ inaŋ azhizhi ayou Abila.<verse eid="HEB 12:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="HEB 12:25" />Tǝ bwe, neliŋ, te kǝr izhin bǝ kyak wɔ iwaŋ ndi alɛ. Abaŋ ndi ate kyak wɔ iwaŋ ndi ablaa ba ilɛ ngɔŋ ne gɔŋmimi bane lieru ba. Itei yi kikini tǝ tai lieru, fe, ate yi ndi taba kam gɔŋ nek iwaŋ ndi alɛ are ishumɔ! <verse eid="HEB 12:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="HEB 12:26" />Ikɔr maa izhaŋ gɔŋmimi ne mkpaŋ yuŋɔ, ama azizaŋa neka kpa aŋyak, &lt;&lt;Ba Mtei na jaŋ gɔŋmimi kɛ ankyak ba te vuŋ ishu maayi,&gt;&gt; <verse eid="HEB 12:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="HEB 12:27" />Ililɛ me, &lt;&lt;atara bla&gt;&gt; ayige ndende te kiki iyi ndi nenai ma itei jaŋ te kpɔb, teduŋ kiki iyiŋ ndi batei jaŋ ba itei klɛ.<verse eid="HEB 12:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="HEB 12:28" />Ndi amɛ, te yi ndi taba ta ikɔb ŋgɔŋ ikɛ yaŋ jaŋ, duŋ tabǝ nyɛr, tena zekur Arik ne nǝgu ŋgɔŋ ben duk asem, <verse eid="HEB 12:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="HEB 12:29" />te Arik amɔr ayi ilu kɛ lɛn kiki izir.<verse eid="HEB 12:29" /></para>
  <chapter eid="HEB 12" />
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="HEB 13" />
  <para style="s1">Ankɔŋ ane duŋ susun kɛ Arik nyɛr</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="HEB 13:1" />Nak nyɛr akpa amin ndi amunwa. Anuŋ ne na amɛ te yaŋ ta abɛ shar Arik ne yaŋ zhi men. <verse eid="HEB 13:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="HEB 13:2" />Duŋ ŋursuk zhin ne ta acɛn ba, te nena amɛ aner anuŋ ane ta abɛ shar Arik ne yaŋ zhi. <verse eid="HEB 13:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="HEB 13:3" />Izhin bǝ shuzhi abaŋ ndi ayi ne jaru, te bǝyi ndi ayi izhineba yi ndɔ. Shuzhi zhin abaŋ ndi ayi ne miŋ kɛ iyah, te bǝyi ndi ayi ijineba.<verse eid="HEB 13:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="HEB 13:4" />Abɛ nek ngɔŋ ne miŋ kɛ Ŋa bɔbɔk, fena lulum bǝn wa abɛ nak gli lɛ kɛ kpa nyak men. Arik atei te abɛ kur bǝn alulum ambuk bǝn amba bǝ kur bǝn alulum. <verse eid="HEB 13:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="HEB 13:5" />Duŋ asusun amin abɛ yaŋ sik ne nyɛr azɔb ba, tena tanyɛme ne iki yiŋ ndi Arik ne nǝgu neyi. Tǝ Arik adi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 13:5">&lt;&lt;Ba M tei nduŋu ba;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 13:5">Kɔka Mŋuru nsuk.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="HEB 13:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="HEB 13:6" />Amɛ ta bla ne zhɔk susun,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 13:6">&lt;&lt;Arik Ŋgɔŋ wa ayine zɔk me ma,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 13:6">Ba M tei ntǝ sisik ba.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 13:6">Iner atei nam anii?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="HEB 13:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="HEB 13:7" />Shuzhi zhin angɔŋgɔŋ abɛ men gli zhin, abaŋ ndi abla zhin ilɛ kɛ Arik. Shuzhi zhin ndi ne yime tena aku, izhin bǝ baŋ ir kɛ tanyɛme iyi asusun mǝne. <verse eid="HEB 13:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="HEB 13:8" />Yesɔ Kristi ayi anenen ba sen ba aliŋ ben iyaŋ klɛtu.<verse eid="HEB 13:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="HEB 13:9" />Kǝr izhin bǝ duŋ abaŋ asusun amin agli tibɛ ne tsar kiki nuŋ yayas ba. Ire te asusun amɔr abɛ yik ŋurklik ne ta zhɔk, bane zǝ tsar iyi ikili; ben abaŋ ndi azǝ tsara ndi batei nǝk ba ikinuŋ didik ba. <verse eid="HEB 13:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="HEB 13:10" />Ine na ndum Arik ayi ne amkpa awaŋ ndi ne nau aŋyak ŋgɔŋ ne tuk amkpur ne akabaŋkɔŋ ndi ba ayi ne mgbyamgbyaŋ kɛ zhɔk kinuŋ nenu ba.<verse eid="HEB 13:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="HEB 13:11" />Ngɔŋ ne na ndum ne akaba ma agli azhizhi ane naarumɔ te yir miŋ Amkpa Angɔŋ ane Tsetser te bɛ yi tuk amkpur ane lalɛ, ama mkpuŋ kpa kɛ naarumɔ agɔŋ kǝ ne abɛm ane akaba ma. <verse eid="HEB 13:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="HEB 13:12" />Neme Yesɔ maayi ne yik iyah te ku ne anɔkɔŋ akɛ goŋ ntun te duŋ aneshir bɛ yi tsetser ne shur azhizhi amaa. <verse eid="HEB 13:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="HEB 13:13" />Duŋ taba, mɔryi, bǝ kɔmɔ anenen bene bɔu ne goŋ ntunɔ, te tabǝ gab iyah iyi yaŋ yigu shak ayi. <verse eid="HEB 13:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="HEB 13:14" />Tǝ ayaŋ ne gɔŋmimi mɔr kǝŋe bata yine ntun nuŋ iyi yaŋ klɛtu ba; taba shur ayi tǝ wɔb ikɔb kɛ nyɛ.<verse eid="HEB 13:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="HEB 13:15" />Neme, tabǝ nak tuk Arik amkpur tena gbaru asak ai yi idɔ gbar iyi lǝlɛn ndi abu anu azho sak maa. <verse eid="HEB 13:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="HEB 13:16" />Duŋ ŋursuk zhin nena didik tena zhɔkzhin akpa ne naki, te waŋa ayi kiki iyi tuk amkpur ndi Arik anyɛri.<verse eid="HEB 13:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="HEB 13:17" />Zǝ zhin ilɛ kɛ angɔŋgɔŋ amin abɛ gli zhin tena zǝ ilɛ men. Azǝn ŋub zhin ndi aneshir abaŋ ndi atei bla iki yiŋ ndi nena. Zǝ zhin lɛ mǝne teduŋ idu mǝne bǝyi kɛ nyɛr, bai hru ba, te iyiŋɛ ba tei yi alɛla anuŋ bene bɛ zhin ba.<verse eid="HEB 13:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="HEB 13:18" />Ben zhin ta Arik, te tane zhi tedi idur mɔrɔ ben bubu ndi tabǝ tsǝntsǝn didik kɔte mkpaŋ takɛ. <verse eid="HEB 13:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="HEB 13:19" />Fena nga mben zhin ngɔŋ te izhin bǝ ben me Arik te duŋu abɛ ashar mǝ akama nyak bene bɛ zhin andanda.<verse eid="HEB 13:19" /></para>
  <para style="s">Iben Arik iyi klɛtu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="HEB 13:20" />Mben Arik ane nek isɔŋ kɛ sik, iwaŋ ndi igar zǝ azhizhi ane kpa nyak iyaŋ klɛ ne akam lɛg Ngɔŋ Yesɔ amɔr aŋyak ne ku, Iwaŋ ndi ayi Ngɔŋ ane awanta, <verse eid="HEB 13:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="HEB 13:21" />ne na zhin aŋyak ne kɔte nii iyi rɛ ne naki ndi ne teu, te ben ndi abɛ nadum ne miŋ mɔr iki iyiŋ ndi ne reu, igar zǝ ben Yesɔ Kristi, iwaŋ ndi ngɔŋ bɛ yi kɛ Yesɔ Kristi ne iyaŋ klɛtu ben iyaŋ klɛtu! Bǝ yeme.<verse eid="HEB 13:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="HEB 13:22" />Amunya, m ben zhin te izhin bǝ gli ilɛ keŋ ndi mne bla zhin ne vuŋ susun, te na cɛr zhin ilɛ wamkpuk.<verse eid="HEB 13:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="HEB 13:23" />Mwɔb te izhin bǝ zhi te izumɔr Timoti neka tunu arumɔ ne jaru. Ate nyɛ yir andanda, M tei ntsan ndɔ te nyɛ bene bɛ zhin.<verse eid="HEB 13:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="HEB 13:24" />Tǝk zhin angɔŋgɔŋ abɛ gli zhin ne ilɛ kɛ Arik ben abɛ zǝ lɛ maa bɔbɔk. Abaŋ ndi ayi ne Italiya adi abɛ tek zhine.<verse eid="HEB 13:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="HEB 13:25" />Ita zhɔk bǝyi ne atu amin bɔbɔk.<verse eid="HEB 13:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="HEB 13" />
</usx>